      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Gambit 0.1.6</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed http(s) tabs that loaded as about:blank: the Chromium page view now loads its pending URL once the browser exists.</li>
<li>Carries the 0.1.5 launch fix so Gambit opens with exactly one New Tab.</li>
<li>Carries the 0.1.4 New Tab navigation fix, per-tab Chromium audio detection, and tab-strip spacing fix.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
